WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:19.078
Toad banged the table angrily.

2
00:00:19.079 --> 00:00:23.207
"The Wild-Wooders had guns?" he said.

3
00:00:23.208 --> 00:00:26.073
"Yes, they did," said Rat.

4
00:00:26.074 --> 00:00:30.134
"What happened?" asked Toad.

5
00:00:30.135 --> 00:00:33.744
Rat told him everything.

6
00:00:33.745 --> 00:00:38.667
"It was a dark, rainy night," said Rat.

7
00:00:38.668 --> 00:00:41.405
"Our friends were sitting by the fire."

8
00:00:41.406 --> 00:00:44.278
Toad listened closely.

9
00:00:44.279 --> 00:00:48.487
"A pack of Wild-Wooders hid outside.

10
00:00:48.488 --> 00:00:51.282
The weasels came in the front.

11
00:00:51.283 --> 00:00:53.866
The ferrets came in the back.

12
00:00:53.867 --> 00:00:57.269
It was a surprise attack!" said Rat.

13
00:00:57.270 --> 00:01:02.000
"What did Mole and Badger do?" asked Toad.

14
00:01:02.001 --> 00:01:04.486
"Nothing," said Rat.

15
00:01:04.487 --> 00:01:08.953
"They were only two animals against so many.

16
00:01:08.954 --> 00:01:11.411
The bullies beat them!"

17
00:01:11.412 --> 00:01:15.043
Toad patted Rat's hand.

18
00:01:15.044 --> 00:01:19.590
"They kicked Mole and Badger out," said Rat.

19
00:01:19.591 --> 00:01:23.604
"The Wild-Wooders moved into Toad Hall."

20
00:01:23.605 --> 00:01:26.817
"Oh my!" said Toad.

21
00:01:26.818 --> 00:01:30.277
"Your house is a mess!" said Rat.

22
00:01:30.278 --> 00:01:34.006
"The weasels eat all your food.

23
00:01:34.007 --> 00:01:37.469
The ferrets drink all your drinks."

24
00:01:37.470 --> 00:01:42.092
"Why, I'll . . . ," cried Toad, shaking.

25
00:01:42.093 --> 00:01:46.142
"And they joke about you!" cried Rat.

26
00:01:46.143 --> 00:01:50.490
"They sing awful songs! Listen:

27
00:01:50.491 --> 00:01:54.753
When Toady went out on the trail,

28
00:01:54.754 --> 00:01:58.677
He never thought he would fail.

29
00:01:58.678 --> 00:02:01.039
But he drove too fast,

30
00:02:01.040 --> 00:02:03.481
His fun didn't last.

31
00:02:03.482 --> 00:02:06.688
Now Toady sits in jail!

32
00:02:06.689 --> 00:02:16.518
Oh! Toady's locked in jail!"
